  "description": [
    "An oxime <em>O</em>-ether that is benzene substituted by a (1<i>E</i>)-<em>N</em>-(2-aminoethoxy)-5-methoxypentanimidoyl group at position 1 and a trifluoromethyl group at position 4. It is a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor that is used for the treatment of obsessive-compulsive disorder."
  ],
